fc-child-fusion (the template generated into the user preset `fc-child`)
combines three sources, all MIT:

1. dsh-anchored-standard (xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard)
   — tool-bootstrap.mjs and the Standard-based composition (persona,
     agent-instructions, tool rows, planning, compaction, delegation).
   https://github.com/xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard
   The anchored-standard NOTICE: it includes an adapted copy of the DeepSeek
   Harness Standard agent preset from
   https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
   commit 47f943859bef60e4160492346772ded9b24f765a (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026
   DeepSeek).

2. dsh-gitbash-preset (lices/dsh-gitbash-preset) v0.1.1
   — gitbash-executor.mjs and the gitbash-shell / filesystem groups
     (the Windows bash-via-Git-Bash executor and the minimal
     str_replace_editor filesystem).
   https://github.com/liceses/dsh-gitbash-preset
   MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 icelily.

3. DeepSeek Harness — the official Minimal persona text ("You are a helpful
   software engineer assistant.") and the official plugin rows referenced by
   name.

Local adaptation performed by desktop/preset-gen.cjs at INSTALL time only:
  - `shellPath` is pinned to the Git-for-Windows bash.exe detected on the
    target machine (the author's auto-detect misses custom install roots).
  - `agentOptions.model` is injected on the subagent spawn/fork rows
    (child-model routing).
The bundled template files themselves carry no machine-specific values.

